  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Performance Accountability in HN by Strengthening Congressional Oversight</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this proposal is to improve accountability of public expenditure management in Honduras by strengthening the institutional capacity of Congress to conduct its oversight role. Overall, the grant will contribute to strengthening the Congressional oversight role by: (i)   supporting the institutional modernization process that the President of Congress has initiated; (ii)   improving transparency and accountability of the Congress itself; and (iii)   enhancing Congress&apos; capacity to analyze and monitor budgets and performance. In turn, this will improve transparency and accountability of the budget process and enhance citizen&apos;s trust in Congress. The objective of this proposal is to improve transparency and accountability of the legislative process in Honduras by strengthening the institutional capacity of Congress. Overall, the grant will contribute to strengthening the Congress by: (i) supporting the institutional modernization process that the President of Congress has initiated; (ii) improving transparency and accountability of the Congress itself; and (iii) enhancing Congress&apos; capacity to analyze and monitor budgets and performance.  In turn, this will improve transparency and accountability of the legislative process and enhance citizen&apos;s trust in Congress.</narrative>
  </description>
